---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import {
  compilerStages,
  evidenceRows,
  metrics,
  repositoryUrl,
  roadmap,
} from "../data/site";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<SiteLayout active="Overview">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-kicker">
        <span class="release-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>ABI8 Prefix correctness · sealed H20 record · performance pending</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Attention semantics.<br /><span>Compiled into state.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        OrbitKV derives when model state can die, synthesizes its physical
        address plan, and authorizes block reuse only after semantic and GPU
        execution frontiers agree.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}/docs/`}>Read the architecture</a>
        <a class="button quiet" href={`${base}/evidence/`}>Inspect evidence boundaries</a>
        <a class="button quiet" href={`${repositoryUrl}/blob/main/docs/capability-matrix.md`}>Capability matrix ↗</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-facts" aria-label="Project boundaries">
        <li>Compiler-generated block plans</li>
        <li>Proof-carrying reclamation</li>
        <li>Explicit L1–L5 qualification</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="kernel-console" aria-label="OrbitKV layout program">
      <div class="console-bar">
        <span>orbitkv://layout/full-swa</span>
        <span class="console-state"><i></i> verified</span>
      </div>
      <div class="console-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="console-body">
        <div class="console-ident">
          <span>RETENTION</span>
          <strong>TOKEN + FIXED STATE · ABI8</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="provider-switch" aria-label="Physical lowering">
          <span class="selected">PAGED</span>
          <span>CUDA VMM</span>
        </div>
        <div class="console-flow">
          <div><small>analyze</small><strong>last_read(q, k)</strong><em>01</em></div>
          <div><small>prepare</small><strong>tail + copy + writes</strong><em>02</em></div>
          <div><small>publish</small><strong>immutable snapshot</strong><em>03</em></div>
          <div class="flow-active"><small>reclaim</small><strong>refs + done + ack</strong><em>04</em></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="console-footer">
        <span>fingerprint / sha256</span>
        <span>frontier / bitemporal</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scope-strip" aria-label="Project boundary">
    <div><span>ORBITKV OWNS</span><strong>state semantics · logical blocks · generations · reclamation proof</strong></div>
    <div><span>ENGINE OWNS</span><strong>model execution · scheduling · attention kernels · request protocol</strong></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="compiler">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Compilation pipeline</p><h2>A block manager emitted from semantics.</h2></div>
      <p>
        Ring, append-only log, pinned region, and VMM are lowering choices.
        The checked lifetime program remains the source of truth.
      </p>
    </header>
    <ol class="execution-chain">
      {compilerStages.slice(0, 4).map((stage) => (
        <li>
          <span class="chain-key">{stage.key}</span>
          <div><h3>{stage.name}</h3><p>{stage.detail}</p></div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section performance-section" id="evidence">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Qualification boundary</p><h2>The ABI8 Prefix path now has a sealed, scoped H20 correctness record.</h2></div>
      <p>
        Exact source 6f62a23 passed all 12 stock/manager pairs across three
        epochs on one H20: Qwen2.5-7B Full and GPT-OSS-20B Full+SWA at B1/B4,
        using official SGLang v0.5.17 with page16 BF16 NHD eager FA3. Outputs
        and request traces match exactly, seeded Prefix hits are observed, all
        arenas drain, and every Hybrid pair advances the required SWA counters.
        Relocation, MLA, fixed-state, overlap, Graph, speculation, distributed
        execution, and performance qualification are excluded.
        The frozen ABI5-v5 H20 record remains historical only.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="metric-grid">
      {metrics.map((item) => (
        <article><strong>{item.value}</strong><div><h3>{item.label}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p></div></article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="evidence-table" role="table" aria-label="OrbitKV evidence summary">
      <div class="evidence-row evidence-head" role="row">
        <span role="columnheader">Result</span>
        <span role="columnheader">Value</span>
        <span role="columnheader">Contract</span>
        <span role="columnheader">Boundary</span>
      </div>
      {evidenceRows.slice(0, 4).map((item) => (
        <div class="evidence-row" role="row">
          <strong role="cell">{item.result}</strong>
          <code role="cell">{item.value}</code>
          <span role="cell">{item.contract}</span>
          <small role="cell">{item.boundary}</small>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href={`${base}/evidence/`}>Inspect methods and exclusions <span>→</span></a>
  </section>

  <section class="section roadmap-section" id="roadmap">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Next gates</p><h2>Expand the qualified ownership surface.</h2></div>
      <p>
        Snapshot, Prefix, fork, joint COW, page-owned reclamation, and the
        official SGLang cache seam now have a sealed, scoped Full/Full+SWA H20
        Prefix record. For fixed state, only initial clear, forward-event
        propagation, and retire/clear/ACK are qualified on the production seam;
        the replacement production trigger and family-specific bindings remain
        pending. Relocation, MLA, fixed-state H20, performance, Graph,
        speculation, and distribution are still open gates.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="milestone-list">
      {roadmap.map((item) => (
        <article><span>{item.state}</span><div><h3>{item.name}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p></div></article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Open source</p><h2>Compile lifetimes. Reuse with proof.</h2></div>
    <div class="closing-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={`${base}/docs/`}>Architecture</a>
      <a class="button quiet" href={repositoryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
